      "action": "root_cause_and_fix_validated",
      "actor": "codex",
      "note": "The approved P11 contract applies the blacklist only to the executable prediction/portfolio interval, but the resolver demanded sector membership from train_start and would truncate pre-test instruments if only its start were changed. The fix preserves pre-test intervals, applies membership from test_start, and retains fail-closed gap/hash/unknown/empty-executable checks.",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-19T19:10:00Z"
    },
    {
      "action": "residual_dataset_blocker_observed",
      "actor": "codex",
      "note": "Read-only v11/R8 evidence after the code fix found 5108 stock-universe symbols overlapping 2024-07-01..2026-08-31 but only 2678 symbols in the frozen membership asset; 2430 remain missing, and every configured index pool also has gaps. This remains a fail-closed immutable data-authority blocker and is not bypassed by BUG-1589.",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-19T19:10:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "evidence_uris": [],
  "expected": "P11 preserves the complete train/validation universe, applies the frozen PIT sector blacklist only over test_start..test_end, retains exact HMM binding, and passes without requiring pre-test sector membership.",
